---
const updated = "January 2026";
---
<section class="policies">
  <div class="policies-hero">
    <span class="label reveal">/Policies</span>
    <h1 class="reveal d2">Privacy, cookies<br>& <em>terms.</em></h1>
    <p class="policies-updated reveal d3">Last updated: {updated}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="policies-body">
    <div class="policy-block scroll-reveal">
      <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>Eternal Optimists respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This placeholder explains, in plain terms, what information we collect, how we use it, and the rights you have over it. Replace this with your reviewed GDPR-compliant privacy text.</p>
      <p>We collect information you provide directly, such as when you contact us or book a session. We use it only to respond to you and deliver our work, and we never sell it to third parties.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block scroll-reveal">
      <h2>Cookie Policy</h2>
      <p>Our website uses a minimal set of cookies to understand how visitors use the site and to improve the experience. This placeholder should describe which cookies you use, their purpose, and how visitors can manage or disable them in their browser.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block scroll-reveal">
      <h2>Terms of Use</h2>
      <p>By using this website you agree to these terms. The content, design, and brand assets on this site are the property of Eternal Optimists unless stated otherwise. This placeholder should set out acceptable use, intellectual property, and any limitations of liability, reviewed for your jurisdiction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-block scroll-reveal">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For any questions about these policies or your data, reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@eternaloptimists.com">hello@eternaloptimists.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
